{"id":"40de54bc10b61c40","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系","display":"Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-satisfaction","aliases":["14-df-satisfaction"],"display":"Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系","depends_on":["[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]","[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","[[14-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"478e22ff3fd55015\" href=\"?note=478e22ff3fd55015\" title=\"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution\">14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)\">\\(M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)\\)</span>；有限元数积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{M_0}\">\\(\\Pi_{M_0}\\)</span> 与结构分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a>，公式、自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"478e22ff3fd55015\" href=\"?note=478e22ff3fd55015\" title=\"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution\">14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</a>。各类载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_s\">\\(M_s\\)</span> 允许为空。</p>\n<p>赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 的定义域只要求为包含当前项或公式自由变量的有限变量集；具体合法赋值集合见下式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}\\)</span> 的定义域是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\">\\((M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M\">\\(\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\\)</span>。项值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^M[\\beta]\">\\(t^M[\\beta]\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\\)</span> 时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in M_s\">\\(a\\in M_s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 的带类型集合箭头求值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_i M_{s_i}\">\\(\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_i M_{s_i}\\)</span> 在 Pack 的输入处表示集合论元组，输出位于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a> 所选的范畴积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in M_r\">\\(m\\in M_r\\)</span> 表示子对象类中的单态射代表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)\\)</span> 是它的源集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Asn}_M:=\\bigcup_{\\substack{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}_S\\\\|D|\\in\\mathbb N}}\\prod_{x\\in D}M_{\\operatorname{sort}(x)},\\qquad\\beta[x:=a]:=\\bigl(\\beta|_{\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\bigr)\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Asn}_M:=\\bigcup_{\\substack{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}_S\\\\|D|\\in\\mathbb N}}\\prod_{x\\in D}M_{\\operatorname{sort}(x)},\\qquad\\beta[x:=a]:=\\bigl(\\beta|_{\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\bigr)\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}(a_1,\\ldots,a_n):=\\iota p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i},p)=a_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}(a_1,\\ldots,a_n):=\\iota p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i},p)=a_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x^M[\\beta]:=\\beta(x),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)^M[\\beta]:=\\operatorname{ev}\\left(M_f,\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(f)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x^M[\\beta]:=\\beta(x),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)^M[\\beta]:=\\operatorname{ev}\\left(M_f,\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(f)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r):=\\{p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\operatorname{ar}(r))\\mid\\exists m\\in M_r\\ \\exists a\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)\\ \\operatorname{ev}(m,a)=p\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r):=\\{p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\operatorname{ar}(r))\\mid\\exists m\\in M_r\\ \\exists a\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)\\ \\operatorname{ev}(m,a)=p\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\top)\\iff\\top,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\bot)\\iff\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\top)\\iff\\top,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\bot)\\iff\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,t=u)\\iff t^M[\\beta]=u^M[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,r(\\vec t))\\iff\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(r)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,t=u)\\iff t^M[\\beta]=u^M[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,r(\\vec t))\\iff\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(r)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\vee\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\vee\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\iff\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\iff\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\forall x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\forall a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\forall x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\forall a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec s=(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\in S_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^nM_{s_i}\\ \\exists!p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\vec s)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,\\vec s,i},p)=a_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\vec s=(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\in S_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^nM_{s_i}\\ \\exists!p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\vec s)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,\\vec s,i},p)=a_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只对有限自由变量赋值，故一个无关的空类不会使句子的全部赋值消失；闭公式可以从空赋值开始求值。空类上的存在量词为假、全称量词为真，均由量词子句直接给出。</p>\n<p>Pack 利用所选集合范畴积的唯一性，把通常元组送入结构实际使用的积；零元输入对应所选终集合的唯一元素。一个集合子对象类的全部代表具有相同像，Rel 将该像写为实际子集，避免原稿把子对象等价类直接放在隶属号右侧。项和公式的有限树递归给出唯一满足关系；一般拓扑斯仍使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a> 的子对象语义与强制关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)$；有限元数积 $\\Pi_{M_0}$ 与结构分量见 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]，公式、自由变量见 [[14-df-formula]]、[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]。各类载体 $M_s$ 允许为空。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)$；有限元数积 $\\Pi_{M_0}$ 与结构分量见 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]，公式、自由变量见 [[14-df-formu