 是它的源集合。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Pack 利用所选集合范畴积的唯一性，把通常元组送入结构实际使用的积；零元输入对应所选终集合的唯一元素。一个集合子对象类的全部代表具有相同像，Rel 将该像写为实际子集，避免原稿把子对象等价类直接放在隶属号右侧。项和公式的有限树递归给出唯一满足关系；一般拓扑斯仍使用 [[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]、[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]] 的子对象语义与强制关系。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Pack 利用所选集合范畴积的唯一性，把通常元组送入结构实际使用的积；零元输入对应所选终集合的唯一元素。一个集合子对象类的全部代表具有相同像，Rel 将该像写为实际子集，避免原稿把子对象等价类直接放在隶属号右侧。项和公式的有限树递归给出唯一满足关系；一般拓扑斯仍使用 [[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]、[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]] 的子对象语义与强制关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\operatorname{StructData}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{M_0}","display":false},{"tex":"M_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\beta,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Asn}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"t^M[\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in M_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_i M_{s_i}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in M_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Asn}_M:=\\bigcup_{\\substack{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}_S\\\\|D|\\in\\mathbb N}}\\prod_{x\\in D}M_{\\operatorname{sort}(x)},\\qquad\\beta[x:=a]:=\\bigl(\\beta|_{\\operatorname{dom}(\\beta)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\bigr)\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)}(a_1,\\ldots,a_n):=\\iota p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,(s_1,\\ldots,s_n),i},p)=a_i.","display":true},{"tex":"x^M[\\beta]:=\\beta(x),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)^M[\\beta]:=\\operatorname{ev}\\left(M_f,\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(f)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r):=\\{p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\operatorname{ar}(r))\\mid\\exists m\\in M_r\\ \\exists a\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(m)\\ \\operatorname{ev}(m,a)=p\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\top)\\iff\\top,\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\bot)\\iff\\bot.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,t=u)\\iff t^M[\\beta]=u^M[\\beta],\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,r(\\vec t))\\iff\\operatorname{Pack}_{M,\\operatorname{ar}(r)}(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_k^M[\\beta])\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_M(r).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\vee\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\iff\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\varphi)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\psi)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\exists a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta,\\forall x:s\\,\\varphi)\\iff\\forall a\\in M_s\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_{14}(M,\\beta[x:=a],\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec s=(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\in S_0^{<\\omega}\\ \\forall(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^nM_{s_i}\\ \\exists!p\\in\\Pi_{M_0}(\\vec s)\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\ \\operatorname{ev}(\\pi_{M_0,\\vec s,i},p)=a_i.","display":true}],"bytes":4284,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-satisfaction|Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-satisfaction|Definition — 集合结构中的递归满足关系]]"},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$\\mathbb T$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小有穷几何理论，$\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S$；演绎与上下文条件采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]。集合模型及其有限赋值满足关系采用 [[14-df-satisfaction]]，模型范畴采用 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]。各类载体允许为空。"}],"outgoing":["478e22ff3fd55015","0d0e27d414f41634","86c3a123f8ca1262","e987275dbc75bae6","28211adc1b0ce5bc","c22badb838a7fca1","eeccd7d0ab927af1"]}